Third-party notices — Duplicate Cleaner
======================================

Scope
-----
Duplicate Cleaner's own Python/QML code and project assets are covered by the
MIT license in LICENSE. Dependencies retain their own licenses. Source archives
and wheels produced by this project do not bundle the Python interpreter or Qt
libraries. RPMs depend on the distribution's Qt/PySide packages. Frozen Windows
bundles include runtime dependencies and require a separate artifact audit.

