PyInstaller
-----------
PyInstaller contributes a bootloader, loader code, and runtime hooks to frozen
bundles. Its bootloader exception permits distribution of combined executables;
runtime hooks and certain runtime modules use Apache-2.0. The full upstream
COPYING.txt for the pinned 6.22.3 version is in LICENSES/PyInstaller-COPYING.txt.
  https://pyinstaller.org/en/stable/license.html

Development tools
-----------------
setuptools, build, and debugpy are development/build dependencies, not declared
application runtime dependencies. Their installation does not by itself imply
that their code is bundled. Inspect the frozen dependency inventory before
making claims about exactly which code is distributed.

Release status
--------------
